{"title":"1995 AIME Problems/Problem 2","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Solution_3\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 3</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Solution_4_(Basically_Solution_3_but_more_detail)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 4 (Basically Solution 3 but more detail)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#See_also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">6</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1995_AIME_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Find the last three digits of the product of the <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Positive_root\" title=\"Positive root\">positive roots</a> of\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/4/8/248953ea700dde4b39dcc4eb05ef5e93d9523c21.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\sqrt{1995}x^{\\log_{1995}x}=x^2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"154\" height=\"18\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1995_AIME_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Taking the <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/0/2/c02bb1fc9984cb7117ca0a4afa89408350d379a5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\log_{1995}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"49\" height=\"17\" /> (<a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Logarithm\" title=\"Logarithm\">logarithm</a>) of both sides and then moving to one side yields the <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Quadratic_equation\" title=\"Quadratic equation\">quadratic equation</a> <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/9/d/d9dd4f299f7b362fc0a17a5bc877864f46036376.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2(\\log_{1995}x)^2 - 4(\\log_{1995}x)  + 1 = 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"268\" height=\"19\" />. Applying the <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Quadratic_formula\" title=\"Quadratic formula\">quadratic formula</a> yields that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/c/d/3cd5db954760e605a014716a4870e9f1e5294953.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\log_{1995}x = 1 \\pm \\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"146\" height=\"41\" />. Thus, the product of the two roots (both of which are positive) is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/f/a/dfad84f8560aee7646ff56caaa68a9be489685b0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1995^{1+\\sqrt{2}/2} \\cdot 1995^{1 - \\sqrt{2}/2} = 1995^2$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"249\" height=\"18\" />, making the solution <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/0/b/a0b7f00042c84cf1274c5b4d3dfd109b7fafc343.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(2000-5)^2 \\equiv \\boxed{025} \\pmod{1000}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"253\" height=\"25\" />.\n</p>\n<pre>Alternatively, use Vieta's formula to find the sum of the roots for solutions of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/f/9/df9e85099856948e2d0ab035390cd15ae50a75ca.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\log_{1995}x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"66\" height=\"19\" /> which yields the product of the two roots.\n</pre>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1995_AIME_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Instead of taking <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/0/2/c02bb1fc9984cb7117ca0a4afa89408350d379a5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\log_{1995}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"49\" height=\"17\" />, we take <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/4/d/04d8dc4fe0e3e81c8a57264d77919263cd8d4631.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\log_x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"30\" height=\"17\" /> of both sides and simplify:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/c/b/ccbcbfa7f9eec1d07e83e1f10d5bea0987b81ef6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\log_x(\\sqrt{1995}x^{\\log_{1995}x})=\\log_x(x^{2})$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"245\" height=\"21\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/c/2/1c2b3e94cc0e17fd0c31b00030635f756d921e22.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\log_x\\sqrt{1995}+\\log_x x^{\\log_{1995}x}=2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"238\" height=\"21\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/0/c/30c590794a81f1e0ff5c21a7b9b79e85d32cfd02.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\dfrac{1}{2} \\log_x 1995 + \\log_{1995} x = 2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"206\" height=\"37\" />\n</p><p>We know that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/4/f/84ff62998e7805218101beaccb67134641c9d721.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\log_x 1995$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"73\" height=\"19\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/f/7/af78a09d19eb228d6c277f97a6b6f7c04749b2aa.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\log_{1995} x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"66\" height=\"19\" /> are reciprocals, so let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/e/1/8e115f262c28a29cf38a14fb71779567e07b6dc7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a=\\log_{1995} x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"97\" height=\"17\" />.  Then we have <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/5/b/e5b2d74cb5519b3975bdf7f9eb0cd15b7529c895.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\dfrac{1}{2}\\left(\\dfrac{1}{a}\\right) + a = 2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -17px\" width=\"120\" height=\"43\" />.  Multiplying by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/c/6/6c6ea4756efa52a156029529aba37a305a5cb496.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"21\" height=\"14\" /> and simplifying gives us <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/b/1/0b1b3e0839af8025de76592609e715be0111ce18.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2a^2-4a+1=0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"131\" height=\"16\" />, as shown above.\n</p><p>Because <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/e/1/8e115f262c28a29cf38a14fb71779567e07b6dc7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a=\\log_{1995} x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"97\" height=\"17\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/4/1/e41f6697110eaef6e6feb45d432aa02d2e7bdbb6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x=1995^a$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"77\" height=\"13\" />. By the quadratic formula, the two roots of our equation are <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/e/2/6e2fe28521f61d8595d5fabd76ca934c8ca3d3af.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a=\\frac{2\\pm\\sqrt2}{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"92\" height=\"41\" />. This means our two roots in terms of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> are <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/e/5/2e5f7ae6a3a9a763eb7d01e8f1408429c23ccc73.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1995^\\frac{2+\\sqrt2}{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"67\" height=\"20\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/0/f/a0f2a8c31d4e2b28f9b673bb4cdb3b87da1c2019.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1995^\\frac{2-\\sqrt2}{2}.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"77\" height=\"22\" /> Multiplying these gives <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/4/8/348c1afcd2619d0a7caa2e4a4e8a3d6c3be5bf3d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1995^2$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"42\" height=\"15\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/e/a/dea964abb065bfcc208ecea92ffe98050b8dd76f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1995^2\\pmod{1000}\\equiv 995^2\\pmod{1000}\\equiv (-5)^2\\pmod{1000}\\equiv 25\\pmod{1000}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"610\" height=\"19\" />, so our answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/c/26c4fe592e51f3609d9a26a1f6ec5e7d57aee090.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{025}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"39\" height=\"23\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_3\">Solution 3</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1995_AIME_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 3\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/c/d/ccd5b42ba52057b6d88d447e58680127d24bc70c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y=\\log_{1995}x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"97\" height=\"17\" />. Rewriting the equation in terms of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/9/2/092e364e1d9d19ad5fffb0b46ef4cc7f2da02c1c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"11\" height=\"13\" />, we have\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/0/5/f0582d6ea015deee1a3de68be096837c3c437415.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\sqrt{1995}\\left(1995^y\\right)^y=1995^{2y}\\]\" width=\"193\" height=\"21\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/e/f/eefcf7773b372a35a4a458ac57dacf274fe45446.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[1995^{y^2+\\frac{1}{2}}=1995^{2y}\\]\" width=\"143\" height=\"19\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/1/3/913d947290f0b93db8713862fac9c65bac479242.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[y^2+\\frac{1}{2}=2y\\]\" width=\"94\" height=\"37\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/e/5/7e550b5ba9f8ccb5d3eff89d7265381011eb55cd.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[2y^2-4y+1=0\\]\" width=\"130\" height=\"18\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/8/a/a8a5d840391bc6081fa2c641da563cdd313da666.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[y=\\frac{4\\pm\\sqrt{16-\\left(4\\right)\\left(2\\right)\\left(1\\right)}}{4}=\\frac{4\\pm\\sqrt{8}}{4}=\\frac{2\\pm\\sqrt{8}}{2}={1\\pm\\sqrt{2}}\\]\" width=\"450\" height=\"41\" />\nThus, the product of the positive roots is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/5/f/25f69f3d97cc05a30647f4f84f8e4f65231c90a1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\left(1995^{\\frac{2+\\sqrt{8}}{2}}\\right)\\left(1995^{\\frac{2-\\sqrt{8}}{2}}\\right)=1995^2=\\left(2000-5\\right)^2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"366\" height=\"32\" />, so the last three digits are <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/c/26c4fe592e51f3609d9a26a1f6ec5e7d57aee090.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{025}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"39\" height=\"23\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Solution_4_.28Basically_Solution_3_but_more_detail.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_4_(Basically_Solution_3_but_more_detail)\">Solution 4 (Basically Solution 3 but more detail)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1995_AIME_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 4 (Basically Solution 3 but more detail)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Set \\( y = \\log_{1995}(x) \\).\n</p><p>Then we have\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/c/5/9c5825b10663c82494acf499d3c900dfd6a5f198.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\sqrt{1995}x^{y}=x^2\\]\" width=\"109\" height=\"18\" />\n</p><p>Also, because \\( y = \\log_{1995}(x) \\), we have \\( 1995^y = x \\), so, our new definition is\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/3/7/03717e2ecd86981cb5f764b78b001474d57afec1.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\sqrt{1995} \\cdot 1995^{y^2}=1995^{2y}\\]\" width=\"188\" height=\"19\" />\n</p><p>Upon which squaring both sides to remove \\( \\sqrt{1995} \\)\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/7/9/b795da93f6a77e177ab882d9797f460b66440546.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[1995 \\cdot 1995^{2y^2}=1995^{4y}\\]\" width=\"178\" height=\"18\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/b/4/fb4cbd1916339d298050a3d33e1fadb1d4f14405.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[1995^{2y^2+1}=1995^{4y}\\]\" width=\"146\" height=\"18\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/6/d/36d958812e1a0b5166fd13d2b5b76f8b195b7838.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[2y^2+1=4y\\]\" width=\"99\" height=\"19\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/e/5/7e550b5ba9f8ccb5d3eff89d7265381011eb55cd.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[2y^2-4y+1=0\\]\" width=\"130\" height=\"18\" />\nSolving the equation yields \\( y_1 = \\frac{2 + \\sqrt{2}}{2} \\) and \\( y_2 = \\frac{2 - \\sqrt{2}}{2} \\), in which now we want to find \\( 1995^{y_1} \\cdot 1995^{y_2} \\mod 1000 \\), or \\( 1995^{\\frac{2+ \\sqrt{2}}{2} + \\frac{2 - \\sqrt{2}}{2}} \\mod 1000 \\), or \\( 1995^2 \\mod 1000 \\), or \\( (2000-5)^2 \\mod 1000 \\), or \\( (2000^2-10 \\cdot 2000+25) \\mod 1000 \\) or \\( (0-0+25) \\mod 1000 \\) or simply <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/c/26c4fe592e51f3609d9a26a1f6ec5e7d57aee090.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{025}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"39\" height=\"23\" />.\n</p><p>~Pinotation\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1995_AIME_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=6\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1995_AIME\" title=\"1995 AIME\">1995 AIME </a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1995_AIME_Problems\" title=\"1995 AIME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1995_AIME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1995 AIME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=45&amp;year=1995\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1995_AIME_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"1995 AIME Problems/Problem 1\">Problem 1</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1995_AIME_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"1995 AIME Problems/Problem 3\">Problem 3</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1995_AIME_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"1995 AIME Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1995_AIME_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"1995 AIME Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1995_AIME_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"1995 AIME Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1995_AIME_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"1995 AIME Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1995_AIME_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"1995 AIME Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1995_AIME_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"1995 AIME Problems/Problem 7\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1995_AIME_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"1995 AIME Problems/Problem 8\">8</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1995_AIME_Problems/Problem_9\" title=\"1995 AIME Problems/Problem 9\">9</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1995_AIME_Problems/Problem_10\" title=\"1995 AIME Problems/Problem 10\">10</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1995_AIME_Problems/Problem_11\" title=\"1995 AIME Problems/Problem 11\">11</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1995_AIME_Problems/Problem_12\" title=\"1995 AIME Problems/Problem 12\">12</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1995_AIME_Problems/Problem_13\" title=\"1995 AIME Problems/Problem 13\">13</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1995_AIME_Problems/Problem_14\" title=\"1995 AIME Problems/Problem 14\">14</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1995_AIME_Problems/Problem_15\" title=\"1995 AIME Problems/Problem 15\">15</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"center\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=AIME_Problems_and_Solutions\" title=\"AIME Problems and Solutions\"> All AIME Problems and Solutions</a></b>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<div class=\"print\">\n<div style=\"display:flex;width:100%;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center\">\n<div>\n<p><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=File:AMC_Logo.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/images/d/d1/AMC_Logo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"97\" height=\"84\" class=\"mw-file-element\" /></a></span>\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"flex-grow:1;text-align:right\">\n<p>These problems are copyrighted &#169; by the <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.maa.org\">Mathematical Association of America</a>. \n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n</div></div>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261017185030\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [show‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.040 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.075 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 301/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 1766/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 88/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 3/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 8301/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   13.145      1 -total\n 57.55%    7.565      1 Template:AIME_box\n 40.17%    5.280      1 Template:MAA_Notice\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:2976:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261017185030 and revision id 283793. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"}